OL,3,GNEWSAWetland almost the size of Hyde
OL,4,APark being created
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to create an area of wetland
OL,7,Falmost the size of Hyde Park has got
OL,8,Funder way.
OL,10,FDiggers are being used on the arable
OL,11,Ffields of Speechly's Farm at the Great
OL,12,FFen nature reserve, near Ramsey in
OL,13,FCambridgeshire.
OL,15,FAbout 136 hectares (336 acres) will be
OL,16,Frestored over the next 12 months with
OL,17,Fpools, channels and reedbeds created
OL,18,Ffor wildlife.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
