OL,3,GNEWSAWetland almost the size of Hyde
OL,4,APark being created
OL,5,
OL,6,FLorna Parker, project manager, said:
OL,7,F"It's taken a huge amount of work from
OL,8,Fa lot of people to get to this point so
OL,9,Fit's amazing to see the diggers finally
OL,10,Fstarting to create the channels which
OL,11,Fwill soon fill with water and create a
OL,12,Fwetland landscape."
